KiroCrew native model catalog compatibility resources

Derived from KiroCrew, Copyright Amazon.com, Inc. or its affiliates.
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE.KiroCrew).
Upstream: https://github.com/kirodotdev/KiroCrew

Modified by kiroaccout contributors to capture asynchronous model catalogs,
retain account-identity checks, and notify the existing official model picker.
No independent workspace, browser, launcher, authentication cache, or fixed model
list is introduced. Exact upstream commits and before/after digests are recorded
in manifest.json. The 0.12.0 frontend corresponding TypeScript source is included.
